= Dough

Beat @butter{113%g}(1 stick, soft) and @sugar{100%g}(1/2 cup) in a #bowl{}.

Add @eggs{2}(large) and @&sugar{50%g}, then chill ~chill{30%minutes}.

> Soft butter means it dents when pressed.

= Bake

Heat the oven to 350°F (175°C). Scoop onto a #baking sheet{} and bake ~bake{12-14%minutes}, using the same #&bowl{} for scraps.

Sprinkle with @?flaky salt{}.
